Z||000003||kong||04-26-2000||09:45 PM||||Use the old high school trick, Take a potato and stick it up his exaust pipe and use a broom handle to stick as far up the pipe as it will go. Take a rag with you to clean any evidence of tampering. It'll take awhile for them to figure it out.<BR>  The first time I did this to the cop car in my hometown it took them two days to figure it out(small town with one car)hehehe. Or if you really want to do some damage Take two baggies and put drano in the first, then put it in the second and drop it in his gas tank. It'll take about 10-15 mins and BOOM no more car. Of course if you're crazy enough to do that one, do it late at night so you won't hurt any innocent pedestrians.<p>[This message has been edited by kong (edited 04-26-2000).]||||reg||1
