Z||000008||wkayl||04-27-2000||10:46 AM||||Very good suggestions if he didn't park in a garage.  I have started bringing my camcorder along.  I have decided to wait untill he goes throuth the 1st stop sign and then follow him all the way to the school.  I will try to pass him a few times and get him on film turning over in front of me.  I will then make a VHS copy and just drop it off at the cop shop.  If nothing is done, I will contact the newspaper or TV station and see if they want to do a story about it.||||reg||14
